        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions TTN100SMTSAL, 1 Inch Door Pull with Straight Square Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Door Pull with Square Mounts has a 1 inch grip and straight mounts. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths and can be finished in modern colors including First Impressions version of powder coated oil rubbed bronze called Lithonia. The Teton Series 2 Door Pull can be surfaced mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Teton Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-TTN02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262336\"><b>First Impressions TTN100SMTSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TTN100012SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>TTN100024SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>TTN100036SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Door Pull with Square Mounts",
                "description": "The Square Door Pull with Square Mounts has a 1 inch grip and straight mounts. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths and can be finished in modern colors including First Impressions version of powder coated oil rubbed bronze called Lithonia. The Teton Series 2 Door Pull can be surfaced mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. \r\n",
